{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_04_end",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_04",
  "title": "掌柜",
  "storyCode": "WR-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c57e7e536efe85130e9c94792a069b5473d9ca57b9fcd6577d274a864fb3145f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "呜呜，呜呜呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "小姑娘呀，你看这天色都亮起来了，咱们也走了挺远的了，就快到了，别哭了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "呜呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "哎呀，有哥哥陪着你，可安全了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "唉......别哭啦别哭啦，都能看到园子了，马上就到啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "咿呀呀——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "怎、怎么这边也有！不是说它们怕太阳的吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "来，你......你骑我头上，抓稳了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "叔叔！叔叔你跑快点啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "别，别揪我头发！眼镜要掉了，要掉了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......乌有这家伙，跑得倒是真挺快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "英雄，您在说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "嗯？啊，没什么，你们快去院子里躲着，外面的警戒交给我就好啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "那个体型的小墨魉，似乎比寻常的源石虫要迅速一些......不过好像有点被绕晕了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "竟然真的跑不过乌有哎......？还有这种事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎......嘎啊......嘎啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "看招！嘿！喝！呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "哈哈！过不来了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "叔叔！你就不能快点跑吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "我早就想这么干了，那些电影里的功夫明星，在街上追逐时一定要掀点什么的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "快、快跑！快跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "别打我脑袋！真把我当驮兽啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "绕过来了！？这都太阳照屁股了，不是说这些玩意怕光的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "救，救命呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "啧！喂，小姑娘，你先走，我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎......嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......是克洛丝恩人！哎哟喂，大恩人呐，您要是帮得到，就早点帮我呀，呃，您、您在哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "在这里哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "呀......！姐、姐姐你从哪里冒出来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "哇！不愧是非同凡响的狙击能手，神出鬼没，落地无声，实在是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "姐姐！谢谢你救了叔叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "赶快回家吧，你妈妈找你很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩人呐，您要不赶紧去帮帮炎熔和嵯峨二位？这儿让我守着，保证周全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......你刚才是不是在炎熔那儿信誓旦旦地说会回去帮她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩、恩人，莫非您有那顺风耳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "没有哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "你这把扇子，怎么一直握在手上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "欸，那必须的，这把扇子可是我最钟爱的物件，乃是我那授业恩师相赠，可舍不得放下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "再说，嘿，手里捧个扇子，不是显得我斯文嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "哼嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "刚才那只墨魉，为什么到了这里也没事？这里算是白天了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "我也想问啊，给那玩意儿追得可累了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "嗯......总之，先去找小炎熔吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......变安静了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "这里明明是在黑夜边缘，只能看见一点点黎明，为什么没有怪物冲向这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧也觉得奇怪，从未如此安静过呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "安静些，不是好事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "嘿！也确是如此，小僧也总算可以喘口气啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "嘿咻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "小心些，别压坏了货件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嵯峨，刚才你说的夕娥......那是指？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "自然是“夕娥奔月”这段佳话中的那位夕娥了，哎呀，小僧至今也忘不掉夕娥那双眸子——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......？？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "嵯峨，你慢点说。炎熔小姐的脸色越来越古怪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "哦，抱歉抱歉，是小僧心急了。方才抵御墨魉，想必炎熔小姐也乏了吧？不如坐下喝杯茶，咱们好好叙叙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "好，那我去为两位泡壶茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "对了，小僧想先问一句，黎姑娘可知道离开这里的办法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "不知？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "（轻轻摇头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
